FuchsiaCity_Interior7_Text_CamperBarry::
	.string "Wahahaha!\p"
	.string "You betcha, dude.\n"
	.string "I’m JANINE!$"

FuchsiaCity_Interior7_Text_CamperBarryDefeat::
	.string "My disguise was right on!\n"
	.string "Dang!$"

FuchsiaCity_Interior7_Text_CamperBarryVictory::
	.string "...$"

FuchsiaCity_Interior7_Text_PicnickerCindy::
	.string "I’m JANINE!\p"
	.string "How did you know I was real?\p"
	.string "Let’s battle!$"

FuchsiaCity_Interior7_Text_PicnickerCindyDefeat::
	.string "Darn it!\n"
	.string "I wanted to win!$"

FuchsiaCity_Interior7_Text_Koga_1::
	.string "KOGA: That little kid...\p"
	.string "Instead of keep on training like I\n"
	.string "told her, she’s just having some fun\l"
	.string "hiding between all the other\l"
	.string "trainers.\p"
	.string "She needs to be more responsible\n"
	.string "about her duty as a GYM LEADER.\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}, can you please battle my\n"
	.string "daughter and teach her what a real\l"
	.string "TRAINER is?$"

FuchsiaCity_Interior7_Text_Koga_2::
	.string "KOGA: I guess we’ll meet again\n"
	.string "sometime soon, {PLAYER}!$"

FuchsiaCity_Interior7_Text_Koga_3::
	.string "KOGA: Thanks, {PLAYER}.\p"
	.string "My daughter seems to be more mature\n"
	.string "now.\p"
	.string "By the way, {PLAYER}.\n"
	.string "You look pretty strong now.\p"
	.string "Do you think we could battle again?$"

FuchsiaCity_Interior7_Text_Koga_4::
	.string "KOGA: Oh, if you have other things\n"
	.string "to take care of, then go ahead.\l"
	.string "I won’t delay you.$"

FuchsiaCity_Interior7_Text_Koga_5::
	.string "KOGA: Great. This time my sinister\n"
	.string "technique will defeat you for sure!$"

FuchsiaCity_Interior7_Text_KogaDefeat::
	.string "Ah!\n"
	.string "Defeated again!$"

FuchsiaCity_Interior7_Text_KogaVictory::
	.string "Fwahaha!$"

FuchsiaCity_Interior7_Text_Koga_6::
	.string "KOGA: You don’t only look strong, but\n"
	.string "you are also strong, indeed.\p"
	.string "Don’t forget that, there’s always the\n"
	.string "chance of meeting someone stronger\l"
	.string "than you.\p"
	.string "That’s why life is a constant\n"
	.string "training.\p"
	.string "Please, accept this gift from me.$"

FuchsiaCity_Interior7_Text_Koga_7::
	.string "KOGA: That is a CHOICE BAND. This\n"
	.string "will power up the strength of any\l"
	.string "move you decide in-battle.\p"
	.string "However, you must be really careful\n"
	.string "with the move you pick.\l"
	.string "That move will be the only one\l"
	.string "available for that battle.\p"
	.string "It all depends on the battle.\n"
	.string "Be wise!$"

FuchsiaCity_Interior7_Text_Lass::
	.string "Well? Wasn’t my disguise perfect?$"

FuchsiaCity_Interior7_Text_LassAlice::
	.string "Fufufu!\p"
	.string "I’m JANINE, the GYM LEADER!\p"
	.string "No, I’m not!\n"
	.string "Gotcha, sucker!$"

FuchsiaCity_Interior7_Text_LassAliceDefeat::
	.string "I had you fooled...$"

FuchsiaCity_Interior7_Text_LassLinda::
	.string "Fooled you!\n"
	.string "Hahaha!$"

FuchsiaCity_Interior7_Text_LassLindaDefeat::
	.string "Ooh... I lost...\n"
	.string "You’re not weak...$"

FuchsiaCity_Interior7_Text_LeaderJanine2Intro::
	.string "Fufufufu...\p"
	.string "I’m sorry to disappoint you...\p"
	.string "I’m only joking!\p"
	.string "I’m the real deal!\p"
	.string "JANINE of FUCHSIA GYM, that’s me!$"

FuchsiaCity_Interior7_Text_LeaderJanine2Defeat::
	.string "JANINE: You’re a tough one. You\n"
	.string "definitely won...\p"
	.string "Here’s SOULBADGE.\n"
	.string "Take it.\p"
	.string "{FONT 0x02}{PLAYER} received the SOULBADGE!{PAUSE_MUSIC}{PLAY_BGM MUS_OBTAIN_BADGE}{PAUSE 0xFE}{PAUSE 0x56}{RESUME_MUSIC}$"

FuchsiaCity_Interior7_Text_LeaderJanine2_1::
	.string "JANINE: I’m going to really apply\n"
	.string "myself and improve my skills.\p"
	.string "I want to become better than both\n"
	.string "Father and you!$"

FuchsiaCity_Interior7_Text_LeaderJanine2_2::
	.string "JANINE: You’re so tough! I have a\n"
	.string "special gift!\p"
	.string "It’s TOXIC, a powerful poison that\n"
	.string "steadily saps the victim’s HP.$"

FuchsiaCity_Interior7_Text_GymGuy_1::
	.string "Yo, CHAMP in making!\p"
	.string "Whoops! Take a good look around\n"
	.string "you. The trainers all look like the\l"
	.string "LEADER, JANINE.\p"
	.string "Which of them is the real JANINE?$"

FuchsiaCity_Interior7_Text_GymGuy_2::
	.string "That was a great battle, trainer\n"
	.string "from JOHTO!$"

FuchsiaCity_Interior7_Text_Picnicker::
	.string "You must be getting tired.$"

FuchsiaCity_Interior7_Text_Camper::
	.string "Hey, dude. Was my disguise cute or\n"
	.string "what, huh?$"

FuchsiaCity_Interior7_Text_Lass3::
	.string "How will you distinguish our real\n"
	.string "LEADER?$"

FuchsiaCity_Interior7_Text_Sign1_1::
	.string "FUCHSIA CITY POKéMON GYM\n"
	.string "LEADER: JANINE\p"
	.string "WINNING TRAINERS:$"

FuchsiaCity_Interior7_Text_Sign1_2::
	.string "FUCHSIA CITY POKéMON GYM\n"
	.string "LEADER: JANINE\p"
	.string "WINNING TRAINERS: {PLAYER}$"
